 0 85.5 0 112v352c0 26.5 21.5 48 48 48h352c26.5 0 48-21.5 48-48V306.2c0-10.7-12.9-16-20.5-8.5l-40 40c-2.2 2.3-3.5 5.3-3.5 8.5z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fas fa-edit icons\"></i> --> Edit Insert</a> <a class=\"btn btn-lg addbut\" href=\"workflow/144948\"><svg class=\"svg-inline--fa fa-list-alt fa-w-16 icons\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-fa-processed=\"\" data-prefix=\"fas\" data-icon=\"list-alt\" role=\"img\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\"><path fill=\"currentColor\" d=\"M464 480H48c-26.51 0-48-21.49-48-48V80c0-26.51 21.49-48 48-48h416c26.51 0 48 21.49 48 48v352c0 26.51-21.49 48-48 48zM128 120c-22.091 0-40 17.909-40 40s17.909 40 40 40 40-17.909 40-40-17.909-40-40-40zm0 96c-22.091 0-40 17.909-40 40s17.909 40 40 40 40-17.909 40-40-17.909-40-40-40zm0 96c-22.091 0-40 17.909-40 40s17.909 40 40 40 40-17.909 40-40-17.909-40-40-40zm288-136v-32c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H204c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v32c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h200c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12zm0 96v-32c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H204c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v32c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h200c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12zm0 96v-32c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12H204c-6.627 0-12 5.373-12 12v32c0 6.627 5.373 12 12 12h200c6.627 0 12-5.373 12-12z\"></path></svg><!-- <i class=\"fas fa-list-alt icons\"></i> --> Insert Workflow</a><br><br><div class=\"whitebar\"><div class=\"col-sm-12\"><div class=\"col-sm-6\"><h2>UPDATE: Nelson Mandela Bay</h2></div><div class=\"col-sm-6 text-right\"><strong>By: <a href=\"user-view/128\">Stenette Grosskopf</a> | Commission</strong></div></div><div class=\"col-sm-12\"><br><div class=\"col-sm-9 inspadd\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Proposal</h3><br><span class=\"headin\">Show:</span> <br><br><span class=\"headin\">Unique Selling Point:</span><br>Two months ago, we visited Gqeberha to report on a questionable tender at the municipal pound - and found a city in crisis.<br>\n<br>\nAfter the SPCA’s contract to manage the Kariega pound expired in December, an emergency tender was awarded to a little-known company and the SPCA was given hours to leave. Concerns surfaced around animal welfare, and money allocated to the pound. The municipality denied money was missing, but admitted that the pound wasn’t functioning fully. <br>\n<br>\nThe dispute has now reached court, where a settlement was reached last month: while the pound remains in the hands of the municipality and its chosen company, a court order has laid out measures to safeguard animal welfare. Meanwhile, the municipality has threatened to go to court to evict the SPCA.<br>\n<br>\nBut the state of the pound is just a microcosm of the city’s infrastructure and leadership crisis, which is only widening…<br>\n<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Hidden Camera:</span> No<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Legal:</span> Yes<br><br><span class=\"headin\">Graphics:</span> No<br></div><div class=\"col-sm-3\"><div class=\"panel panel-default\" style=\"margin:0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">Accept / Reject</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<span class=\"headin\">Status:</span> <span class=\"app\">Approved</span><br><br><span class=\"headin\">Proposal Date:</span> Wednesday, 13 May 2026<br><span class=\"headin\">Approved By:</span> Stenette Grosskopf<br><span class=\"headin\">Approval Date:</span> 13 May 2026<br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-footer\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div><br><div class=\"panel panel-default\" style=\"margin:0px;\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-heading\">Commission</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"panel-body\"><span class=\"headin\">Commission Number:</span> 6903<br><span class=\"headin\">Duration:</span> 3<br><span class=\"headin\">Delivery Date:</span> Sunday, 17 May 2026<br><span class=\"headin\">Legal Viewing:</span> Yes<br><span class=\"headin\">Accepted By:</span> Stenette Grosskopf<br><span class=\"headin\">Accepted Date:</span> 13 May 2026<br></div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\